flowchart LR
    A[Department Need Capture] --> B[Planning Committee Review]
    B --> C[Budget Confirmation]
    C --> D[APP Approval]
    D --> E[Procurement Initiation]
    E --> F[Threshold Resolution]
    F --> G[Method Validation]
    G --> H[Solicitation]
    H --> I[Bid Receipt and Opening]
    I --> J[Evaluation]
    J --> K[Tenders Board Review]
    K --> L{Accounting Officer Gate?}
    L -- No --> N[Award and Publication]
    L -- Yes --> M[Accounting Officer Review]
    M --> O{BPP No Objection Required?}
    O -- No --> N
    O -- Yes --> P[BPP No Objection]
    P --> N
    N --> Q[Contract Execution]
    Q --> R[Inspection and Payment]
    R --> S[Closeout and Audit]

    H -. Complaint .-> T[Administrative Review]
    J -. Complaint .-> T
    N -. Complaint .-> T
    T --> U[Accounting Officer Decision]
    U --> V[BPP Review]

